      "options": {"A": "1P6", "B": "2Y4", "C": "2T0", "D": "1R8"}, "answer": "B",
      "rule": "The two digits give the letter's place in the alphabet: 1P6 → P is the 16th letter, 2T0 → T is the 20th, 1R8 → R is the 18th.",
      "working": "2Y4 → 24, but Y is the 25th letter"
    },
    {
      "id": "oo-b16", "bookNo": 16, "sourcePage": 61, "keyFrom": "book", "pattern": "odd-one", "layout": "odd",
