      "options": {"A": "2", "B": "10", "C": "70", "D": "130"}, "answer": "C",
      "rule": "The others are n³ + n: 1³ + 1 = 2, 2³ + 2 = 10, 5³ + 5 = 130.",
      "working": "4³ + 4 = 68, not 70"
    },
    {
      "id": "oo-b17", "bookNo": 17, "sourcePage": 61, "keyFrom": "book", "pattern": "odd-one", "layout": "odd",
