      "options": {"A": "56, 8", "B": "136, 17", "C": "147, 21", "D": "168, 24"}, "answer": "B",
      "rule": "The first number is 7 times the second: 56 ÷ 8 = 7, 147 ÷ 21 = 7, 168 ÷ 24 = 7.",
      "working": "136 ÷ 17 = 8, not 7"
    },
    {
      "id": "oo-b18", "bookNo": 18, "sourcePage": 61, "keyFrom": "book", "pattern": "odd-one", "layout": "odd",
      "terms": ["15, 46", "12, 37", "9, 28", "8, 33"],
      "options": {"A": "15, 46", "B": "12, 37", "C": "9, 28", "D": "8, 33"}, "answer": "D",
      "rule": "The second number is 3 × the first + 1: 15 × 3 + 1 = 46, 12 × 3 + 1 = 37, 9 × 3 + 1 = 28.",
      "working": "8 × 3 + 1 = 25, not 33"
    },
    {
      "id": "oo-b19", "bookNo": 19, "sourcePage": 61, "keyFrom": "book", "pattern": "odd-one", "layout": "odd",
